<urn:atm:triage:resolution/AY13-QA-005/1>
  a triage:Resolution ;
  triage:resolvedBy "cipher" ;
  triage:resolvedAt "2026-09-07T17:26:47Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:fixCommit "c0afd678d" ;
  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: added AtmError::with_recovery/daemon_unavailable_with_recovery/daemon_connection_saturated_with_recovery to atm-storage::error, and every control-lane construction site in doctor_projection.rs::start/project (worker/queue validation, non-Tokio-runtime start, admission-deadline expiry, queue-full, closed channel, response-deadline expiry, control-lane stop, worker-lane failure) now carries an explicit recovery string matching the doctor subsystem's existing remediation convention. Confirmed with a personally-run `cargo test -p atm-runtime -p atm-storage` (all green) and clippy -D warnings clean at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
